  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "fbd0b428",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 7. Transaction Status Analysis\n",
    "\n",
    "Invoices beginning with `C` are treated as cancelled transactions."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "be34e406",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "\n",
    "df[\"Transaction Status\"] = np.where(\n",
    "    df[\"Invoice\"].astype(str).str.startswith(\"C\"),\n",
    "    \"Cancelled\",\n",
    "    \"Sale\"\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "display(df[\"Transaction Status\"].value_counts())\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "ff336bdd",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "\n",
    "plt.figure(figsize=(7, 5))\n",
    "sns.countplot(data=df, x=\"Transaction Status\")\n",
    "plt.title(\"Sales vs Cancelled Transactions\")\n",
    "plt.xlabel(\"Transaction Status\")\n",
    "plt.ylabel(\"Number of Transactions\")\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.show()\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "468edf80",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 8. Feature Engineering"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "9d7f576d",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "\n",
    "df[\"Revenue\"] = df[\"Quantity\"] * df[\"Price\"]\n",
    "\n",
    "df[\"Year\"] = df[\"InvoiceDate\"].dt.year\n",
    "df[\"Month\"] = df[\"InvoiceDate\"].dt.month\n",
    "df[\"Month Name\"] = df[\"InvoiceDate\"].dt.month_name()\n",
    "df[\"Day\"] = df[\"InvoiceDate\"].dt.day\n",
    "df[\"Day Name\"] = df[\"InvoiceDate\"].dt.day_name()\n",
    "\n",
    "display(df[[\n",
    "    \"InvoiceDate\",\n",
    "    \"Quantity\",\n",
    "    \"Price\",\n",
    "    \"Revenue\",\n",
    "    \"Year\",\n",
    "    \"Month\",\n",
    "    \"Month Name\",\n",
    "    \"Day Name\"\n",
    "]].head())\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "3e981b28",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 9. Sales Dataset\n",
    "\n",
    "For sales-focused analysis, cancelled transactions are separated from successful sales."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "00871c40",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "\n",
    "sales_df = df[df[\"Transaction Status\"] == \"Sale\"].copy()\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"Sales rows:\", len(sales_df))\n",
